From 977edbdd9b66653e23cb5ea35600a47fb305b0e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jouni Malinen <j@w1.fi>
Date: Sat, 28 Dec 2024 10:58:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] EAP-TEAP: Remove deprecated PAC support

RFC 7170bis deprecates use of PAC and there are no known deployments of
it, so remove this functionality completely.

Signed-off-by: Jouni Malinen <j@w1.fi>
---
